### MediFlow — Organization service through the gateway (:8080)
###
### Implemented endpoints:
###   GET/POST /api/v1/org/departments
###   GET      /api/v1/org/departments/{id}
###   PUT      /api/v1/org/departments/{id}
###   GET/POST /api/v1/org/staff
###   GET      /api/v1/org/staff/{id}
###   PUT      /api/v1/org/staff/{id}
###   GET      /api/v1/org/staff/{id}/exists
###   GET      /api/v1/org/staff/{id}/lookup       (service token only)
###   GET      /api/v1/org/departments/{id}/lookup (service token only)
###   PUT      /api/v1/org/staff/{id}/department
###   POST     /api/v1/org/accounts
###   PUT      /api/v1/org/accounts/{id}/status
###   POST     /api/v1/org/accounts/verify
###   GET      /api/v1/org/accounts/{id}/identity (Gateway service token only)
###   POST/PUT /api/v1/org/operating-rooms/{id} (ADMIN authority decisions)
###   PUT      /api/v1/org/staff/{id}/surgery-roles/{teamRole} (ADMIN)
###   GET      /api/v1/org/operating-rooms/{id}/lookup (service token only)
###   GET      /api/v1/org/staff/{id}/surgery-eligibility (service token only)
###
### Credential verification is implemented and called by the Gateway.
### Start order: Eureka (8761) -> gateway (8080) -> core-service (8089).
### Set a valid JWT before calling protected endpoints.

@host = http://localhost:8080
# @token = paste-access-token-here

### List departments; activeOnly=true returns active departments only
GET {{host}}/api/v1/org/departments?activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a department by id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/org/departments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a department
POST {{host}}/api/v1/org/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentName": "Outpatient Department",
  "abbreviation": "OUT",
  "departmentType": "CLINICAL",
  "location": "Building A, Floor 1"
}

### Create a duplicate department abbreviation (expected: 409)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/org/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentName": "Outpatient Department 2",
  "abbreviation": "OUT",
  "departmentType": "CLINICAL",
  "location": "Building A, Floor 2"
}

### Update department head / active state (ADMIN only); departmentHeadId is required, null removes the head
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/org/departments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentName": "Outpatient Department",
  "departmentType": "CLINICAL",
  "location": "Building A, Floor 1",
  "departmentHeadId": null,
  "active": true
}

### List staff with optional department, job title and pagination filters
GET {{host}}/api/v1/org/staff?departmentId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&jobTitle=DOCTOR&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a staff member by id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/org/staff/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a staff member
### Reusing the same key and same request returns the original staff id with HTTP 200;
### the first request returns HTTP 201. Idempotency-Replayed is false/true respectively.
### Reusing the key with a different request returns 409 STAFF_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/org/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: staff-create-2026-10-21-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Alex Morgan",
  "identityNumber": "012345678901",
  "departmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "jobTitle": "DOCTOR",
  "specialization": "Internal Medicine",
  "licenseNumber": "MED123456",
  "phoneNumber": "0901234567",
  "email": "alex.morgan@mediflow.example"
}

### Update staff profile (ADMIN only; department changes use the endpoint below)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/org/staff/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Alex Morgan",
  "jobTitle": "DOCTOR",
  "specialization": "Cardiology",
  "licenseNumber": "MED123456",
  "phoneNumber": "0901234567",
  "email": "alex.morgan@mediflow.example"
}

### Create a doctor without a license number (expected: validation error)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/org/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Taylor Lee",
  "identityNumber": "012345678902",
  "departmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "jobTitle": "DOCTOR",
  "phoneNumber": "0901234568"
}

### Move a staff member to another department
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/org/staff/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/department
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newDepartmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Internal lookup: staff existence and doctor eligibility (SYSTEM token only)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/org/staff/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/exists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 envelope
### data.exists=false, data.eligibleDoctor=false, data.departmentId=null when missing
### data.exists=true, data.eligibleDoctor=false, data.departmentId=null when not an eligible doctor
### data.exists=true, data.eligibleDoctor=true, data.departmentId=<authoritative department> for an active doctor

### Internal lookup: general staff identity (SYSTEM service token only)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/org/staff/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/lookup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Expected 200 data: exists, active, jobTitle and authoritative departmentId

### Internal lookup: department identity (SYSTEM service token only)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/org/departments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/lookup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Expected 200 data: exists, active, departmentId, departmentName and departmentType

### Internal lookup: room identity (SYSTEM service token only)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/org/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/lookup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Expected 200 data: exists, active, roomId, departmentId, roomName and roomType
### A missing room is confirmed absence: exists=false and roomId echoes the requested UUID

### Staff identity additive projection
### data.eligibleTeamRoles is [] for missing/inactive staff;
### DOCTOR => PRIMARY_SURGEON, ASSISTANT_SURGEON, ANESTHESIOLOGIST;
### NURSE => OR_NURSE; other current job titles => []

### Create an account (ADMIN only). Retry this exact body/key after losing the response:
### first success is 201, replay is 200 with the same accountId and Idempotency-Replayed: true.
### Changed body/password with the same key returns 409 ACCOUNT_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/org/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: account-create-2026-10-21-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alex.morgan",
  "password": "StrongPass123",
  "staffId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "role": "DOCTOR"
}

### Deactivate an account (ADMIN only)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/org/accounts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Verify credentials (SYSTEM; called by the gateway)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/org/accounts/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Invalid credentials are returned internally as 422 AUTH_INVALID_CREDENTIALS;
### the Gateway maps that result to public HTTP 401.

{
  "username": "alex.morgan",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}

### Current account identity (Gateway service token only; refresh authority lookup)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/org/accounts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/identity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Expected data: exists, active, accountId, role, staffId, departmentId, patientId, credentialVersion.
### Missing accounts return exists=false; credentials and personal account data are never returned.

### Search accounts (ADMIN; literal keyword, optional role/active, zero-based page)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/org/accounts?keyword=alex&role=DOCTOR&active=true&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change own password (human account; account ID comes from authentication)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/org/accounts/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{currentPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### Reset selected human account password (ADMIN; verify ownership outside this API)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/org/accounts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}
